// Every country without a stated figure opens near 0.7, which is right for most of the world
// and wrong for the thirty in this file: Somalia and Norway were not equally settled countries.
// The figures follow the tiers of the Fragile States Index 2023, compressed into the top of
// the danger band - "very high alert" just above 0.35, "high alert" around 0.4, "alert"
